# s61 — proto-spawn fixture (mirrors demos/5-generate/054-proto-spawn.bqn)
# The proto is the registered archetype, the registry's first row-oriented named-value
# construct. Spawn fill is the three-layer lookup: proto value (soldier, hp), else the
# column's default (ammo), else the type zero (gold). The unique id mints fresh — the
# declared injectivity forces it — and the proto-role column records the archetype noun.
n 2
unique id 3 5
col soldier bool 1 0
col hp num 40 10
col ammo num 7 7
default ammo 5
col gold num 100 200
col proto sym Grunt Grunt
def Marine soldier=1 hp=100
ja 識別 id
ja 兵士 soldier
ja 体力 hp
ja 弾薬 ammo
ja 金 gold
ja 種別 proto
ja 海兵 Marine
